  SOLVEQ line 363 (code.pdf page 23):  DW(I,J,K)=DW(I,J,K)+SOC1+SOC2+SOC3
      DW as printed; the worn D was read as Q
  SOLVEQ line 368 (code.pdf page 23):  C-----V-SOURCE
      comment as printed; worn letters (U, O, B, G) read as L, C, S, C
  SOLVEQ line 376 (code.pdf page 23):  C-----W-SOURCE
      comment as printed; worn letters (U, O, B, G) read as L, C, S, C
  SOLVEQ line 387 (code.pdf page 23):  C-----K-SOURCE
      comment as printed; worn letters (U, O, B, G) read as L, C, S, C
  SOLVEQ line 399 (code.pdf page 23):  C-----E-SOURCE
      comment as printed; worn letters (U, O, B, G) read as L, C, S, C
  SOLVEQ line 407 (code.pdf page 24):  TMDK=DK(I,J,K)+SMNUM
      TMDK as on the next card and in the k-source block; D prints like O
  SOLVEQ line 455 (code.pdf page 24):  IF(IE .EQ. 1) DU(I,J,K)=TJO(I,J,K)*PDUV/(P1-ANAB)
      DU and PDUV as printed
  SOLVEQ line 541 (code.pdf page 26):  UB=0.25*(U(I,J,K)+U(I,J-1,K)+U(I,J,K-1)+U(I,J-1,K-1))
      bottom-face average over K-1 is UB, as DENB above it
  SOLVEQ line 576 (code.pdf page 27):  DENB=DEN(I,J,K-1)
      bottom-face density DENB; B prints like S
